        "original_id": "9f2cad1b-6368-55ce-b8fb-722be54269f8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dave Pirner, Les McKeown, Butch Vig\n- Bands: Soul Asylum, Bay City Rollers\n- Songs: \"Just Like Anyone\"\n\nFacts:\n- Dave Pirner was born on April 16, 1964.\n- Les McKeown was born on November 12, 1955.\n- Les McKeown is a Scottish pop singer.\n- Dave Pirner is an American songwriter, singer, and producer.\n- Dave Pirner is best known as the lead vocalist and frontman of Soul Asylum.\n- Les McKeown was the lead singer of the Bay City Rollers during the band's most successful period.\n- Dave Pirner wrote the song \"Just Like Anyone.\"\n- \"Just Like Anyone\" was produced by the band and Butch Vig.\n- \"Just Like Anyone\" was released as the second single from its album.",
